ies":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","review_id":"RbMD-FvOsVAFygorCCmIhw","date":"2018-09-06T18:36:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9234824180603027,"text_excerpt":"Wanted an affordable brunch our second day in New Orleans so opted for iHop. Our server, Charlie was very friendly, personable and helpful. I ordered a Colorado Omelet and my friend got Split Decision (scrambled eggs, bacon, sausage and French toast). We both got coffee, too. Our food came out in a good amount of time. The kitchen messed up so we got extra pancakes to take with us. The only thing that would've made my food better is if there was sour cream but they ran out. Overall, not a bad meal for $16 each."},{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","review_id":"oOrP7J0QBvIWB6g17sUCYA","date":"2016-03-21T00:50:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9183475971221924,"text_excerpt":"I went to this IHOP for National Pancake Day and received a free stack of buttermilk pancakes. I am surprised that the restaurant has such poor reviews. The restaurant has a great convenient location, being so close to the Marriott, Ritz Carlton, and several other hotels. Our waitress was really sweet and although the chef forgot a couple of things (to put whipped cream on my pancakes when I had asked for it and ice cream on the crepe), she noticed it before she put the plate down on our table and fixed it before we had to ask. Service was quick and would be a great place to grab a quick bite to eat in NOLA."},{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","review_id":"nF_ih7XI3YW8tzQT33wAUA","date":"2016-04-08T21:06:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9089570045471191,"text_excerpt":"We had breakfast at this IHOP located conveniently, just 2 blocks from the Sheraton hotel. Customer service was quite good. We ordered the Veggie Omelette with hash browns and toast. Even though we were starving, the two of us could finish just 90% of it. It seemed they had used 5-6 eggs - it was huge! We were totally stuffed! All for around $10 - a great deal, specially in downtown New Orleans where most places charge a 20-30% premium on food. I would highly recommend this IHOP. Works out great if you are on a budget and willing to share."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","photo_id":"t8VEkD1fr84Zovh38rQBRw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/t8VEkD1fr84Zovh38rQBRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.876990020275116},{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","photo_id":"Uh8EJVC9vQC08g-Qk9jl4g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Uh8EJVC9vQC08g-Qk9jl4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8615342378616333},{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","photo_id":"p2Rg0uYk8SBKLegDgNEPfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/p2Rg0uYk8SBKLegDgNEPfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8197996616363525},{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","photo_id":"CjybXJf4STEw5VPSULVrQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CjybXJf4STEw5VPSULVrQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7625702619552612},{"business_id":"BJBSwMKADtYjqFDCL3-zkw","photo_id":"u5LjukLZl5atY09tY